{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48236","headline":"哭李峤诗 · 崔泰之","name":"哭李峤诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台阁神仙地，衣冠君子乡。\n昨朝犹对坐，今日忽云亡。\n魂随司命鬼，魄逐见阎王。\n此时罢欢笑，无复向朝堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔泰之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}